Description: configure.ac: drop AC_CONFIG_MACRO_DIRS([m4]).
 The tag archive has no m4/ directory, and autoreconf fails on the missing
 macro directory. Unchanged from the port; goes with 0002.
Origin: FreeBSD ports, x11-drivers/xlibre-xf86-input-synaptics/files/patch-configure.ac
 (https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/efd79beed9576dd3e354f889a41dabd5890921f4/x11-drivers/xlibre-xf86-input-synaptics/files/patch-configure.ac)
Forwarded: not yet; a candidate for X11Libre (FreeBSD support)
---
diff -ruN a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -28,7 +28,6 @@
         [xlibre-xf86-input-synaptics])
 AC_CONFIG_SRCDIR([Makefile.am])
 AC_CONFIG_HEADERS([config.h])
-AC_CONFIG_MACRO_DIRS([m4])
 AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR(.)
 
 # Initialize Automake
